{{Quote|Grants life-leeching abilities, useful for tactical takedowns of your enemies.|Shop}}
'''Shadow''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|2,900,000}} or {{Robux|2,425}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Shadow allows the user to control crow-like shadows and cast umbra-based attacks with [[Life Leech]] properties that damage foes. Shadow is quite similar to [[Dark]] in some cases.

